Agent-action receipts — pipelock (Apache License 2.0 CORE)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
`packages/contract/src/receipt-verification.ts` verifies mediator-signed
AI-agent "action receipts" in the format produced by pipelock
(https://github.com/luckyPipewrench/pipelock), an "AI agent firewall for MCP
security".

It uses ONLY the pipelock Apache-2.0-licensed CORE receipt format (the
`action_record` container with a top-level Ed25519 `signature` / `signer_key`
and hash-chain fields). It does NOT use, link, bundle, or depend on any pipelock
feature governed by the Elastic License 2.0 (the "fleet" features, including the
`fleet-receipt` DSSE envelope format).

No pipelock source code is vendored or redistributed here. This product does not
depend on any pipelock npm package (there is no TypeScript verifier SDK); the
Ed25519 signature is verified natively using Node's built-in `crypto` module
against the CORE receipt canonicalization. Portions of pipelock governed by the
Elastic License 2.0 are NOT used by this product.

